/problem "Which of the following are diagonal matrices?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- $F$ is a diagonal matrix. It is square and every off-diagonal entry is zero. It is also an identity matrix; identity matrices are diagonal matrices.\n\n- $H$ is *not* a diagonal matrix. It is square, but an entry off the main diagonal is nonzero: ${h}_{12}=1\\ne 0$.\n\n- $M$ is a diagonal matrix. It is square and every off-diagonal entry is zero. It is also an identity matrix; identity matrices are diagonal matrices.\n\nTherefore, only $F$ and $M$ are diagonal matrices."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186571387 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119772 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b55b50a0-034f-57c0-8a61-883cfb0412dc" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Triangular Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0b13ed41-f685-5293-9b0a-c53f20054a1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186576322} {:answer/id #uuid "a23deefb-3fe2-5af2-a2da-f578b5c7e39a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186576345}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0b13ed41-f685-5293-9b0a-c53f20054a1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186576322} :answer-field/id #uuid "15e873f9-280a-5575-bf0a-1f5e57219bcb" :answer-field/key "$B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186576329} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0bfe3435-fe04-50ff-911e-4143e7ffe4b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186576324} {:answer/id #uuid "e29e5804-332b-5d90-a9f3-a7a754614043" :answer/type {:db/id #edb