gned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “The function $y=f(x)$ is a solution of the differential equation” is true. Since statement “Substituting $y=f(x)$ and $y\\prime=f\\prime(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement” is true, the function $y=3 \\ln{\\left(3 x - 3 \\right)}$ is a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “Substituting $y=f(x)$ and $y\\prime=f\\prime(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement”; “The function $y=f(x)$ is a solution of the differential equation” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186577326 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100888 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "201edc93-37b4-556a-aaea-4fcf9a01077a" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Solution to a First-Order Differential Equation"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "93dc776f-23bf-56b1-9eee-5c4b2ad306a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186577307} {:answer/id #uuid "dfcddebf-600d-5970-aedf-462499d377cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186577322}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "93dc776f-23bf-56b1-9eee-5c4b2ad306a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186577307} :answer-field/id #uuid "45ade0d2-ac27-5c73-9ad6-3be99c3f833b" :answer-field/key "Substituting $y=f(x)$ and $y\\prime=f\\prime(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186577290} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08b1207b-6b24-5b40-bff6-3ccd28f9b09e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186577281} {:answer/id #uuid "97e3f8cb-3337-54fd-b5b1-647afcd593e5" :answer/type {