c_{13}=1$ (condition II is violated).\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -4 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $C$ is **not** in row echelon form."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186619015 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129114 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "2d390841-351e-54f5-ad19-90b6ebae5799" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Matrices in Row Echelon Form"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2b4a4a80-667d-52c6-80ea-2336cc6a2d56" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618998} {:answer/id #uuid "768ded53-8b5e-5eb9-8ea3-44237ca267f5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619008}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "768ded53-8b5e-5eb9-8ea3-44237ca267f5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619008} :answer-field/id #uuid "32c08b9c-0c33-5ef9-840d-d2851889f349" :answer-field/key "$A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -9 & 9 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619000} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "143cfab3-99b7-5ce2-8138-1f32f1d7e780" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618993} {:answer/id #uuid "5b451a2a-3b55-5bd1-bea1-304af4d56a15" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619003}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "143cfab3-99b7-5ce2-8138-1f32f1d7e780" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618993} :answer-field/id #uuid "387ce65e-280a-5b97-b6bb-0811e490cf8b" :answer-field/key "$C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619001} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "10b3820f-0dfe-5473-afac-87ca689c25a3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618991} {:answer/id #uuid "31387c5d-1b0c-5862-8d9f-1224a36ed4c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618999}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "10b3820f-0dfe-5473-afac-87ca689c25a3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186618991} :answer-field/id #uuid "6a3812c8-25f8-5971-98bd-1765f3a9d285" :answer-field/key "$B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 7 & -3 & -9 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 7 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619007}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "95a955ac-07a2-541c-ab8b-4e62bab961a6" :question/problem "Which of the following matrices are **not** in row echelon form?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Remember that a matrix is in row echelon form if it satisfies the following conditions:\n\n- All the zero rows (rows with only zeros), if any, are placed at the *bottom* of the matrix.\n- Each leading entry of a row is in a column *to the right* of the leading entry of the row above it.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each matrix in turn.\n\n- The matrix $A$ is not in row echelon form since the leading entry $a_{33}=-2$ is in the same column as the leading entry $a_{23}=6$ (condition II is violated).\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -9 & 9 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $B$ is not in row echelon form since the first row contains only zeros and it is not at the bottom of the matrix (condition I is violated).\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 7 & -3 & -9 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 7 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $C$ is not in row echelon form since the leading entry $c_{22}=1$ is to the left of the leading entry $c_{13}=5$ (condition II is violated).\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $A,$ $B,$ and $C$ are **not** in row echelon form."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186619025 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129114 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "2d390841-351e-54f5-ad19-90b6ebae5799" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Matrices in Row Echelon Form"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9f9e2b22-cc88-541c-ab5e-59cf84574f20" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619019} {:answer/id #uuid "dc4ea06f-db9d-5e09-b7e7-1a73d864460a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619035}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dc4ea06f-db9d-5e09-b7e7-1a73d864460a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619035} :answer-field/id #uuid "68db4034-e0d1-5973-8b79-67bb50d639da" :answer-field/key "$B=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619006} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8e8eaa15-99bb-5ea4-a28e-7d29ad7f2055" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619013} {:answer/id #uuid "d86492d6-617d-52d8-9b72-049a248db88c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619030}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d86492d6-617d-52d8-9b72-049a248db88c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619030} :answer-field/id #uuid "d8d70363-d26f-5dc0-8ac3-7955a2a48d4b" :answer-field/key "$A=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 6 & -1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -5 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619031} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b312096c-1102-50dc-942c-64a9ec7bf424" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619021} {:answer/id #uuid "c724beb4-fccb-50c8-93b5-fc61476dc528" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619024}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c724beb4-fccb-50c8-93b5-fc61476dc528" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619024} :answer-field/id #uuid "dbf016e9-7259-59eb-9997-e0fd93c8b245" :answer-field/key "$C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & 4 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 9 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186619034}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "c7938343-412b-5fca-92c5-3a72b25b53aa" :question/problem "Which of the following matrices are in row echelon form?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Remember that a matrix is in row echelon form if it satisfies the following conditions:\n\nI. All the zero rows (rows with only zeros), if any, are placed at the *bottom* of the matrix.\n\nII. Each leading entry of a row is in a column *to the right* of the leading entry of the row above it.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each matrix in turn.\n\n- The matrix $A$ is not in row echelon form since the leading entry $a_{34}=-2$ is in the same column as the leading entry $a_{24}=-5$ (condition II is violated).\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 6 & -1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -5 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $B$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $C$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & 4 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 9 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $B$ and $C$ are in row echelon form."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622936 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054814 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3de9e532-559c-5fc1-a6ad-5fcd1ed77824" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Special Sets Containing a Given Element"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "506a3d14-0211-557e-a416-3b84bbb5f071" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622957} {:answer/id #uuid "554bc03a-0e26-5a0b-ba41-13e00d5116e9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622959}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "554bc03a-0e26-5a0b-ba41-13e00d5116e9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622959} :answer-field/id #uuid "44ee2783-210e-5665-8577-9127ca77fa2a" :answer-field/key "Natural numbers ($N$)" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622953} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2e6bc3bd-e28c-5a3a-9c40-fcdd2193e1de" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622948} {:answer/id #uuid "7afb12c2-2cc7-5e47-87fa-7cb5c6297491" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622969}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7afb12c2-2cc7-5e47-87fa-7cb5c6297491" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622969} :answer-field/id #uuid "55551e6f-ad47-55d0-9584-6bcd7b07e0b7" :answer-field/key "Rational numbers ($Q$)" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622960} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2d2e8cf0-eb0c-53a5-90e7-ad4d7d1ae72e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622947} {:answer/id #uuid "54e0390e-44a8-56e7-b64e-01fd783411bb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622958}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "54e0390e-44a8-56e7-b64e-01fd783411bb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622958} :answer-field/id #uuid "a9d935fc-1e70-5518-bd25-3de573f092d3" :answer-field/key "Complex numbers ($C$)" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622985} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "25b3d236-6fc4-5d53-b4de-91d72b7f7254" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622944} {:answer/id #uuid "a57e622a-aaaf-5d9c-9f11-1a5040562295" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622983}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "25b3d236-6fc4-5d53-b4de-91d72b7f7254" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622944} :answer-field/id #uuid "b47cd420-d519-5046-9dbb-35efc391116f" :answer-field/key "Integers ($Z$)" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622989} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "29c30ac2-34fa-5d4b-81fc-1b6392637753" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622946} {:answer/id #uuid "5932ac6a-3356-50ac-8c76-90e09f1979c3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622962}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "29c30ac2-34fa-5d4b-81fc-1b6392637753" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622946} :answer-field/id #uuid "fceb4996-bc39-5928-8d23-8fbc0d681387" :answer-field/key "Real numbers ($R$)" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186623013}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "19e48cbb-c9c8-54e6-ae30-e26b9d815aeb" :question/problem "To which of the following sets does the number $\\frac{56}{7}$ belong?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "![](images/67/67ef97be4b21a74feaae15f3ff30d5077fc1316874df8de79155316a621e4487.png)\n\nRecall the following:\n\n- $N$ represents the set of **natural numbers**.\n\n- $Z$ represents the set of **integers**.\n\n- $Q$ represents the set of **rational numbers**.\n\n- $R$ represents the set of **real numbers**.\n\n- $C$ represents the set of **complex numbers**.\n\nWith that in mind, we note the following:\n\n- The number $\\frac{56}{7}=8$ is a positive whole number, so it belongs to $N.$ We can write\n\n$$\n\\frac{56}{7}\\in N\n$$\n\n- Every natural number is an integer, rational, real, and complex number. Consequently, we can write\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\\frac{56}{7}\\in Z\\qquad \\frac{56}{7}\\in Q \\\\ \\frac{56}{7}\\in R\\qquad \\frac{56}{7}\\in C\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $N, Z, Q, R, C$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622952 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054814 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3de9e532-559c-5fc1-a6ad-5fcd1ed77824" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Special Sets Containing a Given Element"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4b91e5e6-26e7-5c11-a55a-779599b7a0f5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622956} {:answer/id #uuid "a8065df6-811c-5529-b9e5-ff5854f5fa0f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622984}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a8065df6-811c-5529-b9e5-ff5854f5fa0f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622984} :answer-field/id #uuid "71481758-bf29-583c-a311-7cc848969c5a" :answer-field/key "Complex numbers ($C$)" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622966} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ed5e27dc-a9ff-5a6c-a112-bc24d5126f6b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186623007} {:answer/id #uuid "fa5a55e7-8945-51d4-998e-5af4dce43bb6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186623010}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fa5a55e7-8945-51d4-998e-5af4dce43bb6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186623010} :answer-field/id #uuid "7bc41c1c-1c40-51ae-a15b-701481198317" :answer-field/key "Rational numbers ($Q$)" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622970} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6749cceb-0d30-5e64-aa49-226e06c282e6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622963} {:answer/id #uuid "c6edb499-b576-5f7d-970e-4eb8e5ad2058" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622993}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6749cceb-0d30-5e64-aa49-226e06c282e6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622963} :answer-field/id #uuid "8e0e4d17-c57f-5b00-9afd-3ca44dcb1fb7" :answer-field/key "Integers ($Z$)" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622977} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6b215ccc-af87-516f-96b8-6130bccb3f2e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622964} {:answer/id #uuid "6ec7ecfe-5f65-59f5-ac74-4b4514ec1a55" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622965}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6b215ccc-af87-516f-96b8-6130bccb3f2e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622964} :answer-field/id #uuid "a37477de-239a-5dcf-8fde-f60ae1d70ea2" :answer-field/key "Real numbers ($R$)" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622981} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1b30400c-7d45-5023-b5b2-e3e522928884" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622938} {:answer/id #uuid "2560ca98-0e7e-58b6-81ed-b41648ffb08d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622943}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2560ca98-0e7e-58b6-81ed-b41648ffb08d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622943} :answer-field/id #uuid "a545d545-2a00-504d-9175-f1040e2fb9a5" :answer-field/key "Natural numbers ($N$)" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622982}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "41b52700-de9a-5262-ad2b-9f34d3fd4767" :question/problem "To which of the following sets does the number $\\frac{34}{3}$ belong?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "![](images/67/67ef97be4b21a74feaae15f3ff30d5077fc1316874df8de79155316a621e4487.png)\n\nRecall the following:\n\n- $N$ represents the set of **natural numbers**.\n\n- $Z$ represents the set of **integers**.\n\n- $Q$ represents the set of **rational numbers**.\n\n- $R$ represents the set of **real numbers**.\n\n- $C$ represents the set of **complex numbers**.\n\nWith that in mind, we note the following:\n\n- The number $\\frac{34}{3}$ is not an integer, so it does *not* belong to $Z$ nor to $N.$ We can write\n\n$$\n\\frac{34}{3}\\notin N\\qquad \\frac{34}{3}\\notin Z\n$$\n\n- However, it can be written as the ratio of two integers:\n\n$$\n\\frac{34}{3}=\\frac{34}{3}\n$$\n\nConsequently, $\\frac{34}{3}$ is a rational number, and we can write\n\n$$\n\\frac{34}{3}\\in Q\n$$\n\n- Every rational is a real and complex number. Consequently, $\\frac{34}{3}$ belongs to both $R$ and $C,$ and we can write\n\n$$\n\\frac{34}{3}\\in R\\qquad \\frac{34}{3}\\in C\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $Q, R, C$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622968 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054814 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3de9e532-559c-5fc1-a6ad-5fcd1ed77824" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Special Sets Containing a Given Element"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ace9d426-16da-56a6-8983-646e84be21aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622986} {:answer/id #uuid "ec4ea88d-4c62-51b3-8269-157606516b20" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186623006}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ace9d426-16da-56a6-8983-646e84be21aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622986} :answer-field/id #uuid "0d01058f-2c3f-52e0-a113-44824b371885" :answer-field/key "Complex numbers ($C$)" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622934} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2e6d8fe0-a124-53ec-9e84-103183f4cbed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622949} {:answer/id #uuid "753fd7a0-dfa0-58c1-b647-d24cb8362342" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622967}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "753fd7a0-dfa0-58c1-b647-d24cb8362342" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622967} :answer-field/id #uuid "19f80db6-3e9b-52f9-9f11-a7f5780fcf3c" :answer-field/key "Real numbers ($R$)" :answer-field/type {:db/id 