does the number $-12.00$ belong?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "![](images/67/67ef97be4b21a74feaae15f3ff30d5077fc1316874df8de79155316a621e4487.png)\n\nRecall the following:\n\n- $N$ represents the set of **natural numbers**.\n\n- $Z$ represents the set of **integers**.\n\n- $Q$ represents the set of **rational numbers**.\n\n- $R$ represents the set of **real numbers**.\n\n- $C$ represents the set of **complex numbers**.\n\nWith that in mind, we note the following:\n\n- The number $-12.00=-12$ is negative, so it does *not* belong to $N,$ and we can write\n\n$$\n-12.00\\notin N\n$$\n\n- However, $-12$ is an integer, so it does belong to $Z,$ and we can write\n\n$$\n-12.00\\in Z\n$$\n\n- Every integer is a rational, real, and complex number. Consequently, $-12.00$ belongs to $Q,R,$ and $C,$ and we can write\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}-12.00\\in Q\\qquad -12.00\\in R \\\\ -12.00\\in C\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $Z, Q, R, C$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186623024 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054815 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "abc6b3ee-0251-5c9c-9358-bd192c434dd1" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Elements Belonging to Scripted Special Sets"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c1be9efe-ce65-5efc-bb23-f403d34b95f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186623063} {:answer/id #uuid "c4aa668c-e2f8-5e24-a47b-fb284b9a7a76" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186623065}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c4aa668c-e2f8-5e24-a47b-fb284b9a7a76" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186623065} :answer-field/id #uuid "2c2e2c17-4b0d-58a4-9050-8c6d2896e644" :answer-field/key "$-\\frac{7}{8}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 175921864