 is positive, and it is a rational number but not an integer. Therefore, it does *not* belong to $\\mathbb{Z}_0^{-}$.\n\n- $\\frac{6}{6}=1$: It is positive, and it is an integer. Therefore, it does *not* belong to $\\mathbb{Z}_0^{-}$.\n\n- $0$: Zero is included by the subscript $0$. Therefore, it belongs to $\\mathbb{Z}_0^{-}$.\n\n- $-\\sqrt{34}$: It is negative, and it is an irrational real number. Therefore, it does *not* belong to $\\mathbb{Z}_0^{-}$.\n\nIn conclusion, the correct answer is: $0$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186623071 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054815 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "abc6b3ee-0251-5c9c-9358-bd192c434dd1" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Elements Belonging to Scripted Special Sets"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a4738e36-c193-5027-8170-195f57892540" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186623056} {:answer/id #uuid "c7305eeb-9555-5297-a5e1-2afd3db93634" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186623067}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c7305eeb-9555-5297-a5e1-2afd3db93634" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186623067} :answer-field/id #uuid "5c035cac-cb4f-5931-9937-30527d39f9dc" :answer-field/key "$-8.5$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186623036} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6d1bbafe-68f2-5614-8848-5359eaf828f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186623042} {:answer/id #uuid "c24ec1ab-5d21-56c9-951b-63069001f7d5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186623064}] :answer-field/correct